kanta2fhir
==========

This repository includes terminology tables derived from third-party sources.

FinOMOP mappings
----------------
kanta2fhir/terminology/data/labfi.csv and kanta2fhir/terminology/data/icd10fi.csv are
derived from the FinOMOP mapping files (https://github.com/FinOMOP/FinOMOP_mappings,
commit recorded in kanta2fhir/terminology/data/sources.json). FinOMOP is the Finnish
OHDSI national node; OHDSI artifacts are open source and free. The Finnish code names
originate from the Finnish national code sets maintained by THL and Kuntaliitto.

