Not included
------------
WHO ICD-10 and ATC English titles and SNOMED CT content are not redistributed beyond
the few SNOMED CT codes in snomed.csv used as mapping targets. WHO titles are fetched
locally into the git-ignored vocab/ directory with tools/fetch_titles.py.
